</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Someone asked for a <span style="display:inline-block">new invitation</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">Someone with an expired invitation link to <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Souza Bakery</b> asked for a <span style="display:inline-block">new one.</span></p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">If you expect them, send a new invitation from Members. If not, there&#39;s nothing <span style="display:inline-block">to do.</span></p>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/settings/members" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Open Members</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
