</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Confirm your spot on <span style="display:inline-block">the list</span></h1>
