</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-doug-2.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-rosa-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-sony-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-mark-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Seu acesso <span style="display:inline-block">está pronto</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">rafa@ estudio. design</b> já pode criar uma conta e um workspace <span style="display:inline-block">no DougBot.</span></p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">O DougBot é onde pessoas e agentes de IA <span style="display:inline-block">trabalham juntos.</span></p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/signup?email=rafa%40estudio.design&amp;access=Hk3vQ9xLm2Tz8Rb5Wc1Yd7Fg4Jn6Ps0Ua2Ve9Xi3Ko" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Criar minha conta</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">O link vale por 14 dias, só para este endereço. Cadastre-se com uma senha, ou com Google, GitHub ou Apple neste <span style="display:inline-block">mesmo endereço.</span></p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#565a52">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/signup?email=rafa%40estudio.design&amp;access=Hk3vQ9xLm2Tz8Rb5Wc1Yd7Fg4Jn6Ps0Ua2Ve9Xi3Ko" target="_blank" style="color:#565a52;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dde0d8;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/signup?email=rafa%40estudio.design&amp;access=Hk3vQ9xLm2Tz8Rb5Wc1Yd7Fg4Jn6Ps0Ua2Ve9Xi3Ko</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Você recebeu este e-mail porque este endereço está na lista de espera do DougBot, ou foi convidado para o DougBot. Nada acontece até você <span style="display:inline-block">se cadastrar.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Enviado pelo servidor do DougBot <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
