<td width="44" valign="top" style="width:44px;padding:5px 0 12px"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-squircle-1-pilula-1.png" width="32" height="32" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:32px;height:32px"></td>
<td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 12px">
<p class="ink" style="margin:0;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Theo</p><p class="mu" style="margin:0;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Usou 100% do orçamento deste mês · <span style="display:inline-block">Padaria Souza</span></p></td>
</tr></table>
<table width="100%" class="warn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f6ecd2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 16px"><tr>
<td class="warn-t" style="padding:14px 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#8a5a00">Ele não responde até o mês virar, ou até um admin subir <span style="display:inline-block">o limite.</span></td></tr></table>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/agents/a1?tab=settings&amp;sec=budget" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Ver o orçamento</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Você recebeu este e-mail porque é dono deste agente, ou admin da Padaria Souza. É enviado em 80% e em 100%, uma vez por <span style="display:inline-block">mês cada.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Enviado pelo servidor do DougBot <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

