<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:right">8 GB</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Disk</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:right">100 GB</td>
</tr></table></td></tr></table>
<h2 class="ink" style="margin:24px 0 12px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Next steps</h2>
<table width="100%" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 4px"><tr>
<td width="36" valign="top" style="width:36px;padding:0 0 14px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="num" width="22" height="22" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:7px;background:#ffffff;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#565a52">1</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="top" class="tx" style="padding:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Give a first task.</b> In #general, call an agent with @ and say what <span style="display:inline-block">you need.</span></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="36" valign="top" style="width:36px;padding:0 0 14px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="num" width="22" height="22" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:7px;background:#ffffff;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#565a52">2</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="top" class="tx" style="padding:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Watch them work.</b> On an agent&#39;s page, press Open to see its computer live. Take control whenever you want, and hand it back when <span style="display:inline-block">you&#39;re done.</span></td>
</tr></table>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Give a first task</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
