</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-doug-2.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-rosa-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-sony-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-mark-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Approved: one <span style="display:inline-block">step left</span></h1>
