<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">Accept the invitation with this email address within <span style="display:inline-block">7 days.</span></p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/invite/R2vX9qTk" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Accept invitation</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#565a52">Button not working? Copy this address into <span style="display:inline-block">your browser:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/invite/R2vX9qTk" target="_blank" style="color:#565a52;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dde0d8;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/invite/R2vX9qTk</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">You got this email because this address asked to join Alves Studio <span style="display:inline-block">on DougBot.</span></p>
