<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-bone-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#ededed"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Seu código</h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">Digite este código para apagar a conta inteira <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">ana@ padariasouza. com. br</b>, não só um workspace. Ela sai de todos os aparelhos na hora e é apagada de vez 7 dias depois, e os workspaces em que só você está fecham <span style="display:inline-block">com ela.</span></p>
<table width="100%" class="well" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#eef0eb;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 20px"><tr>
<td class="ink" align="center" style="padding:16px 16px 16px 24px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:32px;line-height:40px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:center">482913</td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Vale por 10 minutos, e nada é apagado sem ele. Se não foi você, não passe para ninguém e avise quem cuida <span style="display:inline-block">deste servidor.</span></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Você recebeu este e-mail porque sua conta pediu para ser apagada <span style="display:inline-block">no DougBot.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Enviado pelo servidor do DougBot <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

