<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#565a52">Button not working? Copy this address into <span style="display:inline-block">your browser:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue" target="_blank" style="color:#565a52;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dde0d8;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue</a></p>
