<td class="tx" style="padding:14px 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#0a0a0a">Não foi você? Aperte o botão em até 7 dias. Este endereço volta, todas as sessões são encerradas, os apps de IA são desconectados e jeitos de entrar adicionados desde então deixam de valer. A senha também é apagada, e “Esqueci a senha” cria <span style="display:inline-block">a próxima.</span></td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Não fui eu</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Se foi você, não precisa <span style="display:inline-block">fazer nada.</span></p>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#565a52">O botão não funcionou? Copie e cole este endereço <span style="display:inline-block">no navegador:</span><br><a class="ln-m" href="https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue" target="_blank" style="color:#565a52;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dde0d8;text-underline-offset:3px;word-break:break-all">https://agentes.chat/email-undo?token=Hk2dQ9xWm4Lp7Rt1Vb8Nc3Zs6Yf0Ja5Ue</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Você recebeu este e-mail porque este endereço era o e-mail de uma conta <span style="display:inline-block">do DougBot.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Enviado pelo servidor do DougBot <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`every email, in both languages workspace_deleting-owner.en: snapshot 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
