<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Carlos Souza</b> conectou o seu plano do Claude ao agente <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Ada</b>. As conversas dele usam o seu plano e os <span style="display:inline-block">limites dele.</span></p>
