</style>
<!--[if !mso]><!--><style>@font-face{font-family:'Inter';font-style:normal;font-weight:100 900;font-display:swap;src:url('https://x.test/email/inter-latin.woff2') format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:'Manrope';font-style:normal;font-weight:200 800;font-display:swap;src:url('https://x.test/email/manrope-latin.woff2') format('woff2')}</style><!--<![endif]-->
</head>
<body class="body bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background:#f4f6f2;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all">Seu workspace está pronto. Falta um plano do DougBot para ele começar.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;</div>
<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Seu time está esperando" lang="pt-BR" dir="ltr">
<table role="presentation" class="bg" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f6f2">
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 24px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="552" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:552px;margin:0 auto">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 0 20px">
<a href="https://x.test" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">
<img class="logo-ink" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-ink-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#0a0a0a">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-bone-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#ededed"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-doug-2.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-rosa-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-sony-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td><td valign="bottom" style="padding:0 8px 0 0"><img src="https://x.test/email/bot-mark-1.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:44px;height:44px"></td></tr></table><h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Seu time <span style="display:inline-block">está esperando</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">4 agentes, 3 grupos e 2 rotinas estão prontos. Falta um plano do DougBot para <span style="display:inline-block">eles começarem.</span></p>
<table class="end-btn" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 6px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat/org/6f1d2c9a-58c1-4f7e-9d3b-2a7c1e0b9f44/settings/billing" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Ver planos do DougBot</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Você recebeu este e-mail porque administra Padaria Souza no DougBot. São só dois avisos <span style="display:inline-block">como este.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Enviado pelo servidor do DougBot <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

