</head>
<body class="body bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background:#f4f6f2;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all">You have 7 days to change your mind.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#8199;&shy;</div>
<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Your DougBot account will be deleted on November 6, 2026" lang="en" dir="ltr">
<table role="presentation" class="bg" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f6f2">
<tr><td align="center" class="px" style="padding:0 24px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="552" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:552px;margin:0 auto">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 0 20px">
<a href="https://x.test" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">
<img class="logo-ink" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-ink-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#0a0a0a">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-bone-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#ededed"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Your account is <span style="display:inline-block">being deleted</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">We will delete the account <b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">ana@ souzabakery. com</b> on November 6, 2026 at 1:42 PM EST. It&#39;s signed out everywhere, and nobody can reach you here until <span style="display:inline-block">you&#39;re back.</span></p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">The workspace only you were in closed now and goes on the same date: <span style="display:inline-block"><b class="ink" style="font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Souza Bakery</b>.</span></p>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">Changed your mind? Sign in before that date and <span style="display:inline-block">press Restore.</span></p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 20px"><tr><td><a class="btn" href="https://agentes.chat" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#9cfa05;border:1px solid #9cfa05;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(63,102,0,.22),0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,10,.14),0 8px 18px -8px rgba(63,102,0,.55);color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:at-least;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 15px;mso-padding-alt:0;text-underline-color:#9cfa05"><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%;mso-text-raise:187%" hidden>&emsp;</i><![endif]--><span style="mso-text-raise:93%;color:#0a0a0a">Sign in to restore</span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:107%" hidden>&emsp;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></a></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">If it wasn&#39;t you, write <span style="display:inline-block">to <a class="ln-m" href="mailto:help@agentes.chat" style="color:#565a52;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dde0d8;text-underline-offset:3px">help@agentes.chat</a>.</span></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">You got this email because this address has an account <span style="display:inline-block">on DougBot.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Sent by the DougBot server <span style="display:inline-block">at x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`every email, in both languages account_deleting.pt-BR: snapshot 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR" dir="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no,date=no,address=no,email=no,url=no">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light only">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}
</style>
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.bg{background:#0a0a0a!important}.card{background:#121212!important;border-color:#262626!important}.ink{color:#ededed!important}.tx{color:#ededed!important}.mu{color:#999999!important}.fa{color:#8a8a8a!important}.well{background:#1a1a1a!important}.wh{border-color:#262626!important}.num{background:#121212!important;border-color:#262626!important;color:#999999!important}.btn{background:#9cfa05!important;color:#0a0a0a!important;border-color:#9cfa05!important}.btn span{color:#0a0a0a!important}.ln{color:#ededed!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}.avp{background:#1a1a1a!important;color:#ededed!important;border-color:#262626!important}.warn{background:#2e2410!important}.warn-t{color:#f5b544!important}.ln-d{color:#f2555a!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}.ln-m{color:#999999!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}.end-btn{margin-bottom:4px!important}.logo-ink{display:none!important}.logo-bone{display:block!important}}
</style>
<style>
[data-ogsc] .bg{background:#0a0a0a!important}[data-ogsb] .bg{background:#0a0a0a!important}
[data-ogsc] .card{background:#121212!important;border-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .card{background:#121212!important;border-color:#262626!important}
[data-ogsc] .ink{color:#ededed!important}[data-ogsb] .ink{color:#ededed!important}
[data-ogsc] .tx{color:#ededed!important}[data-ogsb] .tx{color:#ededed!important}
[data-ogsc] .mu{color:#999999!important}[data-ogsb] .mu{color:#999999!important}
[data-ogsc] .fa{color:#8a8a8a!important}[data-ogsb] .fa{color:#8a8a8a!important}
[data-ogsc] .well{background:#1a1a1a!important}[data-ogsb] .well{background:#1a1a1a!important}
[data-ogsc] .wh{border-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .wh{border-color:#262626!important}
[data-ogsc] .num{background:#121212!important;border-color:#262626!important;color:#999999!important}[data-ogsb] .num{background:#121212!important;border-color:#262626!important;color:#999999!important}
[data-ogsc] .btn{background:#9cfa05!important;color:#0a0a0a!important;border-color:#9cfa05!important}[data-ogsb] .btn{background:#9cfa05!important;color:#0a0a0a!important;border-color:#9cfa05!important}
[data-ogsc] .btn span{color:#0a0a0a!important}[data-ogsb] .btn span{color:#0a0a0a!important}
[data-ogsc] .ln{color:#ededed!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .ln{color:#ededed!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}
[data-ogsc] .avp{background:#1a1a1a!important;color:#ededed!important;border-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .avp{background:#1a1a1a!important;color:#ededed!important;border-color:#262626!important}
[data-ogsc] .warn{background:#2e2410!important}[data-ogsb] .warn{background:#2e2410!important}
[data-ogsc] .warn-t{color:#f5b544!important}[data-ogsb] .warn-t{color:#f5b544!important}
[data-ogsc] .ln-d{color:#f2555a!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .ln-d{color:#f2555a!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}
[data-ogsc] .ln-m{color:#999999!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}[data-ogsb] .ln-m{color:#999999!important;text-decoration-color:#262626!important}
[data-ogsc] .end-btn{margin-bottom:4px!important}[data-ogsb] .end-btn{margin-bottom:4px!important}
[data-ogsc] .logo-ink{display:none!important}[data-ogsb] .logo-ink{display:none!important}
[data-ogsc] .logo-bone{display:block!important}[data-ogsb] .logo-bone{display:block!important}
</style>
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme:light){.btn{background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#c5ff52 0%,#9cfa05 55%,#84e407 100%)!important}}
</style>
<style>
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.btn{background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#c5ff52 0%,#9cfa05 55%,#84e407 100%)!important}}
</style>
<title>Sua conta do DougBot vai ser apagada em 6 de novembro de 2026</title>
