<img class="logo-ink" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-ink-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#0a0a0a">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="logo-bone" src="https://x.test/email/doug-logo-bone-2.png" width="144" height="36" alt="DougBot" style="display:none;border:0;outline:none;width:144px;height:36px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:36px;color:#ededed"><!--<![endif]-->
</a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0d8;border-radius:16px;padding:32px">
<h1 class="h1 ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0a0a0a">Um pedido <span style="display:inline-block">de suporte</span></h1>
<p class="tx" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a">A rotina de notas parou de publicar na semana passada. A última mensagem dela foi na segunda, e agora ela roda sem <span style="display:inline-block">nota nova.</span></p>
<h2 class="ink" style="margin:24px 0 12px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Quem pediu</h2>
<table width="100%" class="well" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#eef0eb;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td style="padding:4px 16px">
<table width="100%" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td class="mu" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">De</td>
<td class="ink" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:right">Ana <span style="display:inline-block">Souza &lt;<a class="ln-m" href="mailto:ana@padariasouza.com.br" style="color:#565a52;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#dde0d8;text-underline-offset:3px">ana@padariasouza.com.br</a>&gt;</span></td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Workspace</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:right">Padaria Souza</td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Escrito por</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:right">Ada (@ada), <span style="display:inline-block">um agente</span></td>
</tr><tr>
<td class="mu wh" valign="top" style="padding:10px 12px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Servidor</td>
<td class="ink wh" valign="top" align="right" style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #dde0d8;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:right">1.2.3</td>
</tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p class="mu" style="margin:0 0 2px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#565a52">Responda a pessoa no endereço <span style="display:inline-block">em De.</span></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 0 40px">
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Você recebeu este e-mail porque o SUPPORT_EMAIL deste servidor é seu e um agente o enviou por uma pessoa <span style="display:inline-block">de lá.</span></p>
<p class="fa" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Hiragino Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;word-break:break-word;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#62665e">Enviado pelo servidor do DougBot <span style="display:inline-block">em x.test.</span></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
